<title>USA: U.S. Facilities stake held by group.</title>
<headline>U.S. Facilities stake held by group.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-11-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>A group led by Dorchester Partners L.P. said Thursday it held a 6.07 percent stake in U.S. Facilities Corp or 363,600 common shares.</p>
<p>In a filing with the Securities and Exchange Commission, the group said its latest transactions include the purchase of 118,300 common shares between Oct 2 and Nov 19 at prices ranging from $17.375 to $19.80 per share.</p>
<p>The stake is held for investment purposes, the company said in the filing.</p>
